00:00:03.662 --> 00:00:06.365
DETAINED.

00:00:05.097 --> 00:00:08.767
CORRESPONDENT CASEY STEAGALL IS

00:00:06.498 --> 00:00:11.136
IN THE AREA WITH THE LATEST.

00:00:08.901 --> 00:00:13.505
&gt;&gt; Reporter: THIS JUST IN FROM

00:00:11.270 --> 00:00:16.275
JAKE GIBSON, ONE OF OUR INTREPID

00:00:13.639 --> 00:00:17.809
PRODUCERS THERE IN D.C. WHERE HE

00:00:16.408 --> 00:00:18.911
SAID THE JUSTICE DEPARTMENT, THE

00:00:17.943 --> 00:00:20.112
U.S. JUSTICE DEPARTMENT

00:00:19.044 --> 00:00:22.614
OFFICIALS HAVE TOLD FOX NEWS

00:00:20.245 --> 00:00:26.351
THAT FEDERAL CHARGES ARE VERY

00:00:22.748 --> 00:00:28.554
MUCH UNDER CONSIDERATION HERE.

00:00:26.485 --> 00:00:29.421
AT THIS AS AUTHORITIES TONIGHT

00:00:28.687 --> 00:00:30.656
ARE STILL PROCESSING THAT

00:00:29.555 --> 00:00:32.958
MASSIVE CRIME SCENE NOT FAR FROM

00:00:30.789 --> 00:00:33.792
WHERE I AM OVER AT THE

00:00:33.091 --> 00:00:36.195
HIGH SCHOOL.

00:00:33.926 --> 00:00:37.429
ALSO, DIGGING DEEP INTO THE

00:00:36.328 --> 00:00:41.166
17-YEAR-OLD GUNMAN'S PAST, WHICH

00:00:37.563 --> 00:00:43.769
WE ARE TOLD DID NOT RAISE MANY

00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:45.971
RED FLAGS PRIOR TO THIS MORNING.

00:00:43.902 --> 00:00:48.407
&gt;&gt; WE COME TOGETHER TODAY AS WE

00:00:46.104 --> 00:00:49.808
DEAL WITH ONE OF THE MOST

00:00:48.540 --> 00:00:53.145
HEINOUS ATTACKS THAT WE HAVE

00:00:49.942 --> 00:00:53.579
EVER SEEN IN THE HISTORY OF

00:00:53.278 --> 00:00:55.247
TEXAS SCHOOLS.

00:00:53.712 --> 00:00:58.150
&gt;&gt; Reporter: IN EARLY MORNING

00:00:55.380 --> 00:01:00.352
TRAGEDY ON TEXAS' GULF COAST

00:00:58.283 --> 00:01:03.088
AFTER POLICE SAY A MALE STUDENT

00:01:00.485 --> 00:01:06.725
WALKED INTO A HIGH SCHOOL ART

00:01:03.222 --> 00:01:09.161
CLASS WITH A SHOTGUN AND

00:01:06.858 --> 00:01:13.865
REVOLVER AND OPENED FIRE.

00:01:09.294 --> 00:01:16.335
THEY SAY IT WAS A SCENE OF CHAOS

00:01:13.999 --> 00:01:19.137
AND CONFUSION.

00:01:16.468 --> 00:01:22.374
&gt;&gt; SEVERAL OF MY FRIENDS GOT

00:01:19.271 --> 00:01:25.344
SHOT, AND AS SOON AS THE ALARM

00:01:22.507 --> 00:01:27.779
WENT OFF, EVERYBODY RAN OUTSIDE.

00:01:25.477 --> 00:01:28.080
AND I JUST RAN AS FAST AS I

00:01:27.913 --> 00:01:30.882
COULD.

00:01:28.213 --> 00:01:31.183
&gt;&gt; I JUST RAN AS FAST AS I

00:01:31.016 --> 00:01:34.853
COULD.

00:01:31.316 --> 00:01:35.254
&gt;&gt; IT WAS SCARY, I DIDN'T KNOW

00:01:34.987 --> 00:01:37.589
WHAT TO DO.

00:01:35.387 --> 00:01:38.457
&gt;&gt; THE ATTACK HAPPENED AT

00:01:37.723 --> 00:01:40.559
7:30 A.M. FRIDAY MORNING AT

00:01:38.590 --> 00:01:43.562
SANTA FE HIGH SCHOOL IN THE

00:01:40.692 --> 00:01:44.162
SMALL CITY OF SANTA FE, 35 MILES

00:01:43.695 --> 00:01:46.031
SOUTHEAST OF HOUSTON.

00:01:44.296 --> 00:01:47.633
WITNESSES SAY THAT AT FIRST THEY

00:01:46.164 --> 00:01:48.934
THOUGHT IT WAS A FIRE DRILL.

00:01:47.766 --> 00:01:51.403
&gt;&gt; THE FIRE ALARM WAS PULLED AND

00:01:49.067 --> 00:01:55.407
WE WERE TOLD TO GO OUTSIDE.

00:01:51.536 --> 00:01:57.442
WE GOT A FEW GUARD SHOTS.

00:01:55.540 --> 00:01:59.144
&gt;&gt; Reporter: POLICE SAY HE MAY

00:01:57.576 --> 00:01:59.911
HAVE BEEN PLANNING SOMETHING

00:01:59.278 --> 00:02:01.947
MORE SINISTER.

00:02:00.045 --> 00:02:04.516
THERE HAVE BEEN EXPLOSIVE

00:02:02.080 --> 00:02:05.851
DEVICES FOUND IN THE HIGH SCHOOL

00:02:04.650 --> 00:02:07.552
AND SURROUNDING AREAS.

00:02:05.984 --> 00:02:09.054
&gt;&gt; Reporter: THIS IS A FOURTH

00:02:07.686 --> 00:02:11.623
FATAL SCHOOL SHOOTING IN THE

00:02:09.187 --> 00:02:12.257
UNITED STATES THIS YEAR.

00:02:11.757 --> 00:02:15.360
THOSE IN THE COMMUNITY ARE

00:02:12.391 --> 00:02:15.727
SHOCKED IT HAPPENED IN THEIR

00:02:15.494 --> 00:02:17.963
COMMUNITY.

00:02:15.861 --> 00:02:19.798
&gt;&gt; IF THIS CAN HAPPEN AND

00:02:18.096 --> 00:02:20.165
SANTA FE, IT CAN HAPPEN IN

00:02:19.931 --> 00:02:21.767
ANYWHERE.

00:02:20.299 --> 00:02:22.968
&gt;&gt; I SHOULDN'T BE GOING THROUGH

00:02:21.900 --> 00:02:24.836
THIS AT MY SCHOOL.

00:02:23.101 --> 00:02:25.771
LIKE THIS IS MY DAILY LIFE, I

00:02:24.970 --> 00:02:26.171
SHOULDN'T HAVE TO FEEL LIKE

00:02:25.904 --> 00:02:30.542
THAT.

00:02:26.305 --> 00:02:31.143
AND I FEEL SCARED TO EVEN GO

00:02:30.676 --> 00:02:31.777
BACK.

00:02:31.276 --> 00:02:35.013
&gt;&gt; Bret: INVESTIGATORS SAY

00:02:31.910 --> 00:02:36.148
THAT THE GUNMAN HAD TWO WEAPONS

00:02:35.147 --> 00:02:37.683
ON HIM.

00:02:36.281 --> 00:02:39.818
WE UNDERSTAND THAT BOTH BELONGED

00:02:37.816 --> 00:02:41.153
TO THE SUSPECTS FATHER AND THEY

00:02:39.951 --> 00:02:42.454
WERE LEGALLY ACQUIRED.

00:02:41.286 --> 00:02:44.890
IN ADDITION TO THE TEN PEOPLE

00:02:42.587 --> 00:02:50.562
WHO LOST THEIR LIVES HERE TODAY,

00:02:45.023 --> 00:02:51.930
TEN OTHERS WERE SERIOUSLY HURT,

00:02:50.696 --> 00:02:53.665
INCLUDING A SCHOOL RESOURCE

00:02:52.064 --> 00:02:57.002
OFFICER WHO WAS SHOT WHILE

00:02:53.799 --> 00:02:59.738
TRYING TO HELP THE SUSPECT.

00:02:57.135 --> 00:03:00.972
BRET, TONIGHT HE HAS BEEN

00:02:59.871 --> 00:03:02.974
CREDITED AS A HERO AND CREDITED

00:03:01.106 --> 00:03:03.742
WITH SAVING MANY MORE LIVES.

00:03:03.108 --> 00:03:07.346
BACK TO YOU.

00:03:03.875 --> 00:03:07.846
&gt;&gt; Bret: CASEY, AN ARRAIGNMENT

00:03:07.479 --> 00:03:08.513
FOR THE SUSPECT?

00:03:07.979 --> 00:03:10.382
&gt;&gt; Reporter: WE UNDERSTAND

00:03:08.647 --> 00:03:11.116
THAT IS SUPPOSED TO HAPPEN

00:03:10.515 --> 00:03:14.386
WITHIN THE HOUR.

00:03:11.249 --> 00:03:16.154
HE IS IN CUSTODY WITHIN

00:03:14.519 --> 00:03:17.155
GALVESTON COUNTY AND WE

00:03:16.288 --> 00:03:18.357
UNDERSTAND THAT ARRAIGNMENT IS

00:03:17.289 --> 00:03:21.159
SCHEDULED TO HAPPEN SOMETIME

00:03:18.490 --> 00:03:23.395
WITHIN THE NEXT 45 MINUTES OR

00:03:21.293 --> 00:03:26.031
SO, BEING CHARGED WITH CAPITAL

00:03:23.528 --> 00:03:27.599
MURDER AND AGGRAVATED ASSAULT OF

00:03:26.164 --> 00:03:29.968
A POLICE OFFICER, IN ADDITION TO

00:03:27.733 --> 00:03:30.335
WHAT I SAID AT THE TOP OF THE

00:03:30.102 --> 00:03:33.372
BROADCAST.

00:03:30.469 --> 00:03:34.473
THAT INFORMATION CAME FROM JAKE

